{"story_id":"KR-51002-040","title":"God's Way","title_raw":"XL      GOD'S WAY","notes":"","language":"en","original_language":"ko","country":"Korea","country_code":"KR","culture_region":"朝鮮半島","latitude":36.6,"longitude":127.9,"location_precision":"culture_region","map_location_type":"source_culture_region","collector":"Im Bang; Yi Ryuk","translator":"James S. Gale","publication_year":1913,"year_evidence":"扉に 1913(序文の署名は 1911)","book_id":"PG-51002","book_title":"Korean Folk Tales: Imps, Ghosts and Fairies","source_provider":"Project Gutenberg","source_url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/51002","source_title":"Korean folk tales : $b Imps, ghosts and fairies","license_status":"PUBLIC_DOMAIN_US","license_name":"Public Domain (United States)","license_jurisdiction":"US","rights_evidence_url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/51002","redistribution_allowed":true,"commercial_use":true,"derivative_use":true,"ml_processing_status":"reviewed","verification_date":"2026-09-08","word_count":190,"text":"In a certain town there lived a man of fierce and ungovernable\ndisposition, who in moments of anger used to beat his mother. One\nday this parent, thus beaten, screamed out, \"Oh, God, why do you not\nstrike dead this wicked man who beats his mother?\"\n\nThe beating over, the son thrust his sickle through his belt and\nwent slowly off to the fields where he was engaged by a neighbour\nin reaping buckwheat. The day was fine, and the sky beautifully\nclear. Suddenly a dark fleck of cloud appeared in mid-heaven, and\na little later all the sky became black. Furious thunder followed,\nand rain came on. The village people looked out toward the field,\nwhere the flashes of lightning were specially noticeable. They seemed\nto see there a man with lifted sickle trying to ward them off. When\nthe storm had cleared away, they went to see, and lo, they found the\nman who had beaten his mother struck dead and riven to pieces.\n\nGod takes note of evil doers on this earth, and deals with them as\nthey deserve. How greatly should we fear!\n\nYi Ryuk.\n\nXLI","cluster":3,"analysis":{"analysis_version":"1.0","embedding_model":"intfloat/multilingual-e5-small","themes":[],"motifs":[],"animals":[],"nature":[{"label":"海","count":2,"method":"count","confidence":1.0},{"label":"雷","count":2,"method":"count","confidence":1.0},{"label":"風","count":1,"method":"count","confidence":1.0}],"events":[{"position":0.0,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":0.091,"label":"Family","hits":1,"lift":15.71,"method":"count"},{"position":0.182,"label":"Death","hits":1,"lift":60.6,"method":"count"},{"position":0.273,"label":"Family","hits":1,"lift":15.71,"method":"count"},{"position":0.364,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":0.455,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":0.545,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":0.636,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":0.727,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":0.818,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":0.909,"label":"Death","hits":1,"lift":60.6,"method":"count"},{"position":1.0,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"}],"tension":[{"position":0.0,"tension":0.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.091,"tension":1.0,"raw":6.667,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.182,"tension":0.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.273,"tension":0.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.364,"tension":0.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.455,"tension":0.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.545,"tension":0.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.636,"tension":0.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.727,"tension":0.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.818,"tension":0.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.909,"tension":0.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":1.0,"tension":0.6,"raw":4.0,"method":"lexicon"